# Credentials (example only)

Copy to a private env / Cursor secrets store. **Do not commit real values.**

```bash
# Hugging Face — model downloads
export HF_TOKEN=""
# export HUGGING_FACE_HUB_TOKEN=""

# Cloud APIs — use sparingly (daily limits); local models first
export GEMINI_API_KEY=""
export NVIDIA_API_KEY=""
```

See `docs/environment.md` for policy.
